#: src/gui/about.rs:263
msgid ""
"Ferret is made by one person (Petru101 on GitHub), not a company. Most of "
"its code was written by Claude (Anthropic's AI), directed and tested on real "
"games by that person. Nobody independent has checked it. Its code is public, "
"so anyone can read it or build it themselves. New versions are built on "
"GitHub's servers from that code, then signed with its maker's key, and "
"updates without that signature are refused. On Windows, you can check where "
"a download came from: gh attestation verify FILE -R Petru101/ferret "
"(GitHub's gh tool, signed in). That shows where the file came from, not that "
"the code is safe."
msgstr ""

